      "content": "it doesn't feel temporary though. it feels like the floor just fell out from under me. i've worked my whole life to be someone, to provide, to be respected. now im just a joke. like i can see everyone i know looking at me and just seeing a loser. the shame is so loud i can’t even sleep. it’s just constant dread.",
